<p class="has-text-align-left wp-block-paragraph">The first book in the trilogy, The Phoney War, starts the journey off, introducing the main characters and the plot, it is a lighter and slower paced read than the second two books, mainly concentrating on how everything starts, developing the plot, the characters, the science and the technology for the action in the second two.</p>



